# dependency-watch.ignore
#
# Packages intentionally NOT tracked as rows in dependency-watch.csv.
# Supports exact package names and trailing-* prefix globs. # comments
# and blank lines are skipped.
#
# NOT a place to hide risky deps. Anything that can break a user-facing
# flow belongs in dependency-watch.csv with a real severity.

# personal_automation_platform is currently a planning repo: docs/PRD,
# VISION, and architecture decision records only. No service has been
# scaffolded (no package.json / pyproject.toml / source). Decision 002
# selects NestJS + Prisma + Postgres + Inngest as the future stack.
# Re-run the dependency-watch bootstrap once the service scaffold lands.
